# Networking (Dio)

## Client setup
- ✅ One Dio instance configured in `lib/shared/networking/dio_provider.dart` (`dioProvider`)
- ✅ Set:
  - connect/receive/send timeouts
  - baseUrl per flavor via `AppConfig.instance.apiBaseUrl`
  - common headers

## Interceptors
- ✅ Auth token injection from `authTokenProvider`
- ✅ Request ID / correlation via `X-Request-Id` (`RequestId.newId()`)
- ✅ Safe logging (no secrets/PII) using `AppLogger`:
  - keep auth headers redacted by default
  - only allow unredacted logs via `--dart-define=UNREDACT_HTTP_LOGS=true` in local debug
- ✅ Error mapping into typed failures using `DioFailureMapper` (`lib/shared/networking/dio_failure_mapper.dart`)
- ✅ Local-only TLS relaxation is allowed only for `AppEnvironment.local` (IO only)

## DTO + mapping
- ✅ Decode to DTOs, then map to domain entities
- ✅ Domain layer must not depend on Dio types

## Cancellation
- ✅ Use CancelToken for cancelable requests (search/typeahead)

## NEVER
- ❌ Call Dio directly from widgets
- ❌ Return raw JSON maps from repositories
- ❌ Swallow network errors; always map and surface appropriately
